%%{init: {
  "flowchart": {
    "nodeSpacing": 0,
    "rankSpacing": 0,
    "padding": 0,
    "diagramPadding": 100,
    "htmlLabels": true,
    "useMaxWidth": true,
    "curve": "linear",
  },
  "themeVariables": {
    "fontSize": "40px",
    "fontFamily": "Arial, sans-serif"
  }
}}%%
flowchart TD

classDef start    fill:#e8f4f8,stroke:#2C5F8A,color:#1a1a2e,rx:12
classDef step     fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2C5F8A,color:#1a1a2e
classDef decision fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,color:#1a1a2e
classDef route    fill:#d1fae5,stroke:#065f46,color:#1a1a2e
classDef calc     fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#5b21b6,color:#1a1a2e
classDef refund   fill:#fce7f3,stroke:#9d174d,color:#1a1a2e
classDef settle   fill:#e0e7ff,stroke:#3730a3,color:#1a1a2e
classDef closure  fill:#cffafe,stroke:#0e7490,color:#1a1a2e
classDef terminal  fill:#2C5F8A,stroke:#2C5F8A,color:#fff,rx:12
classDef none     fill:#f3f4f6,stroke:#9ca3af,color:#374151,rx:12

START([Window opens]):::start --> WIN

WIN[1. Elect assessment window 1 yr free · 2-7 yr: premium]:::step --> ROUTE

ROUTE[2. Assign each asset to Route A / B / C / D]:::step --> PRIV

PRIV[3. Privacy election per asset]:::step --> PRIV_Q

PRIV_Q{Disclosed or private?}:::decision
PRIV_Q -->|Disclosed: rate discount| VAL
PRIV_Q -->|Private: rate premium| VAL

VAL[4. Value assets by route]:::step

VAL -->|Route A: professional fungible| RA[Route A]:::route
VAL -->|Route B: professional non-fungible| RB[Route B]:::route
VAL -->|Route C: self-declared fungible| RC[Route C in-kind settlement]:::route
VAL -->|Route D: self-declared non-fungible| RD[Route D deferred to realisation]:::route

RA & RB & RC & RD --> NW

NW[5. Calculate net worth]:::calc --> THRESH

THRESH{Above threshold?}:::decision
THRESH -->|No| BELOW([No WDT due Report still filed]):::none
THRESH -->|Yes| RATE

RATE[6. Marginal rate + wealth delta]:::calc --> SIGN

SIGN{Delta?}:::decision
SIGN -->|Positive: gain| TAX[Tax = rate x delta]:::calc
SIGN -->|Negative: loss| REFUND[Symmetric refund SWF pre-funded]:::refund

TAX & REFUND --> SETTLE

SETTLE[7. Settle by route A: cash · B: lien · C: in-kind · D: deferred]:::settle --> ADMIN

ADMIN[8. Administrator credential 6 months: submit · 1 year: pay]:::step --> REGISTER

REGISTER[9. Public register updated Taxpayer history recorded]:::step --> SWF

SWF[10. Net revenue to SWF Refund reserve · labour relief reserve]:::refund --> LOOP

LOOP{Window closed?}:::decision
LOOP -->|No — file annual report| LOOP
LOOP -->|Yes — new window| WIN

LOOP --> CLOSE

CLOSE{Closure event?}:::decision
CLOSE -->|Death| CL1[Final delta Inheritance auction]:::closure
CLOSE -->|Exit| CL2[Bridging facility Depart before settlement]:::closure
CLOSE -->|Fall-through| CL3[Final delta Envelope preserved]:::closure
CLOSE -->|Bankruptcy| CL4[Final delta Refund fires]:::closure

CL1 & CL2 & CL3 & CL4 --> END_POS

END_POS([Position closed Lifetime envelope persists]):::terminal
